('advanced-native-172', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-172-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It may influence purchasing choices without removing alternatives."],"options":["It proves shoppers have already bought more.","It may influence purchasing choices without removing alternatives.","It forces every shopper to buy the same item.","It guarantees a permanent change in every habit."]},"advanced-native-172-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The display makes them easier to notice.","It may nudge their buying behaviour towards reusable options.","Customers can see the alternatives before choosing.","The shop wants people to consider those products earlier."],"options":["The display makes them easier to notice.","It may nudge their buying behaviour towards reusable options.","Customers can see the alternatives before choosing.","The shop wants people to consider those products earlier."]},"advanced-native-172-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The labels may nudge their buying behaviour towards refill options."],"options":["The labels remove every choice from shoppers.","The labels prove every customer has permanently changed habits.","The labels may nudge their buying behaviour towards refill options."]},"advanced-native-172-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The display may nudge their buying behaviour."],"options":["The display shows the current prices clearly.","The display may nudge their buying behaviour.","The display may nudge people in a certain direction."]},"advanced-native-172-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It can nudge their buying behaviour while leaving them free to choose."],"options":["Ignore the display when evaluating the choice because the customer could still refuse.","It can nudge their buying behaviour while leaving them free to choose.","Describe the display’s influence as proof that the customer had no choice."]},"advanced-native-172-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The clearer display may nudge my buying behaviour towar