('advanced-native-177', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-177-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Being accepted while still having different ideas."],"options":["Making every member think exactly alike.","Avoiding every conversation until the club changed its activities.","Being accepted while still having different ideas.","Hiding every personal interest permanently."]},"advanced-native-177-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I am beginning to fit in with the group.","They listen to my ideas even when they differ from theirs.","The regular activities have helped me feel more welcome.","I am starting to know people and feel comfortable joining in."],"options":["I am beginning to fit in with the group.","They listen to my ideas even when they differ from theirs.","The regular activities have helped me feel more welcome.","I am starting to know people and feel comfortable joining in."]},"advanced-native-177-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["I am starting to fit in."],"options":["I must abandon every different opinion to be accepted.","My role is only to copy everyone without contributing.","I am starting to fit in."]},"advanced-native-177-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Someone must have exactly the same interests and opinions as every member."],"options":["Someone feels accepted in a group.","Someone must have exactly the same interests and opinions as every member.","A social setting begins to feel more comfortable."]},"advanced-native-177-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["You can fit in and still have your own views. A welcoming group makes room for differences."],"options":["Judge whether you belong mainly by how closely your opinions match the group’s.","You can fit in and still have your own views. A welcoming group makes room for differences.","Keep your different ideas to yourself until the group has accepted you."]},"advanced-native-177-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["You can fit in without sharing every interest. Join our activity and tell